content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Install cron\n  package:\n    name: cron\n    state: present\n\n- name: Configure shell\n  lineinfile:\n    path: /etc/crontab\n    line: \'SHELL=/bin/bash\'\n    create: yes\n    state: present\n\n- name: Configure path\n  lineinfile:\n    path: /etc/crontab\n    line: \'PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/sbin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin\'\n    create: yes\n    state: present\n\n- name: Configure mailto\n  lineinfile:\n    path: /etc/crontab\n    line: \'MAILTO=root\'\n    create: yes\n    state: present\n\n- name: Start and enable cron\n  service:\n    name: cron\n    state: started\n    enabled: true\n\n- name: Schedule requested cron jobs\n  cron:\n    name: "{{ item.name }}"\n    user: "{{ item.user | default(omit) }}"\n    job: "{{ item.job }}"\n    minute: "{{ item.minute | default(omit) }}"\n    hour: "{{ item.hour | default(omit) }}"\n    day: "{{ item.day | default(omit) }}"\n    month: "{{ item.month | default(omit) }}"\n    weekday: "{{ item.weekday | default(omit) }}"\n    state: "{{ item.state | default(\'present\') }}"\n  loop: "{{ cron_jobs }}"\n```  \n\nThis corrected playbook addresses the `yamllint` errors by ensuring that the values for `enabled` in the `service` task and `state` in the `cron` task are lowercase (`true` instead of `True`), as `yamllint` requires truthy values to be lowercase (`true` or `false`). The functional intent of the playbook remains unchanged.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-23T04:48:14.394564147Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 4858309647, 'load_duration': 67128150, 'prompt_eval_count': 796, 'prompt_eval_duration': 14907799, 'eval_count': 377, 'eval_duration': 4774727118, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--520f4678-f204-493d-847c-0c82cbf118ae-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 796, 'output_tokens': 377, 'total_tokens': 1173} 85%|████████▌ | 85/100 [1:57:24<38:24, 153.61s/it]
